Golden Fleece is a standalone adaptation of the KatanOS / Housekeeper bank rewards module.
It adds an independent desktop shell, local-only record storage and packaging.

Bank reward tracking incorporates ideas and adapted logic from Bank Bonus Tracker (commit 42de84e),
https://github.com/pumpkinperson996/bank-bonus-tracker, under the MIT license.
Full license texts for the adapted module and bundled renderer dependencies are in licenses/.
Electron and Chromium licenses are included in the desktop distribution.

